# ── Build output, test runs and generated data (chore/repo-cleanup) ──────────
# NOTE: `artifacts/` is deliberately NOT used unanchored. Unanchored it also
# matches ignition/deployments/<chain>/artifacts/, which holds deployment
# RECORDS (live proxy addresses and upgrade history), not build output. Those
# must stay tracked. Root Hardhat output is already covered by /artifacts
# and /cache above.
subgraph/build/
subgraph/generated/
test-results/
frontend/test-results/
scripts/out/
*.tsbuildinfo
leaderboard-export.json

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
